  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAIF contribution to the Project &apos;&apos;Promoting climate change adaptation and integrated water resources management investment in the water and sanitation sector in Latin America in the framework of the Spanish Cooperation Fund for Water and Sanitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the project is promote the following thematic: water and sanitation, water access and quality services through the &apos;Integrated Water Resources Management&apos; (IWRM) approach, building of infrastructure, capacity building and policy development.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
